# Nothing ignored here any more.
#
# `series/` was ignored during the 2015-onward backfill, because it is
# regenerated in full from params/ + weights/ and the intermediate state of a
# partial backfill is not worth keeping. The backfill is complete, so the
# series is now the artefact the page actually fetches and has to be
# committed.
#
# Regenerating it monthly is cheap in git despite the file size: two versions
# of the 368 KB world.json pack into 113 KB together, so an appended frame
# deltas down to near nothing.
